---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site"; // Assuming site.ts is used for dynamic data like email

const lastUpdated = "October 10, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | IT Support Bee">
  <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0f0224] pt-32 pb-32 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="mb-12 text-center">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase border-2 border-[#2D058A] text-[#2D058A] dark:border-[#90ee02] dark:text-[#90ee02] rounded-full shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(45,5,138,1)] dark:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(144,238,2,0.4)]"
        >
          Legal
        </div>
        <h1
          class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-[#2D058A] dark:text-white tracking-tighter mb-4 leading-tight"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest"
        >
          Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Content Container -->
      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-[#150734] border-4 border-[#2D058A] dark:border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-[12px_12px_0px_0px_rgba(45,5,138,1)] dark:shadow-[12px_12px_0px_0px_rgba(144,238,2,0.3)]"
      >
        <article
          class="prose prose-lg md:prose-xl prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none custom-prose"
        >
          <p>
            At <strong>IT Support Bee</strong>, accessible from <a
              href="https://itsupportbee.com">itsupportbee.com</a
            >, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors and
            clients. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information
            that is collected and recorded by IT Support Bee and how we use it.
          </p>

          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            We collect several different types of information for various
            purposes to provide and improve our service to you:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Personal Data:</strong> While using our Service, we may ask
              you to provide us with certain personally identifiable information,
              including your email address, first name and last name, phone number,
              and company details.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Usage Data:</strong> We may also collect information on how
              the Service is accessed and used. This may include information such
              as your computer's Internet Protocol address (e.g. IP address), browser
              type, browser version, and the pages of our Service that you visit.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the collected data for various purposes, including:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              To provide, operate, and maintain our IT support services and
              cloud migrations.
            </li>
            <li>
              To notify you about changes to our infrastructure, maintenance
              schedules, or policies.
            </li>
            <li>To provide customer support and respond to your inquiries.</li>
            <li>
              To monitor the usage of our Service and improve website
              performance.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
          <p>
            Like any other website, IT Support Bee uses 'cookies'. These cookies
            are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and
            the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The
            information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing
            our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other
            information.
          </p>

          <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            We may employ third-party companies and individuals to facilitate
            our Service (e.g., Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, MultCloud), to
            provide the Service on our behalf, or to assist us in analyzing how
            our Service is used. These third parties have access to your
            Personal Data only to perform these tasks on our behalf and are
            obligated not to disclose or use it for any other purpose.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            The security of your data is important to us. As IT professionals,
            we implement robust security protocols including SPF, DKIM, DMARC,
            and strict SSL/TLS encryption. However, remember that no method of
            transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage is
            100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to
            protect your Personal Data, we cannot guarantee its absolute
            security.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy,
            do not hesitate to contact us.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              By email: <a
                href={`mailto:${site?.email || "hello@itsupportbee.com"}`}
                >{site?.email || "hello@itsupportbee.com"}</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              By visiting our Contact page: <a href="/contact"
                >itsupportbee.com/contact</a
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Markdown Typography Spacing & Colors for Legal Pages */
  .custom-prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;
    line-height: 1.8 !important;
  }

  .custom-prose h2 {
    color: #2d058a;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 3.5rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .custom-prose ul,
  .custom-prose ol {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;
    padding-left: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .custom-prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
  }

  .custom-prose a {
    color: #2d058a;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose a {
    color: #90ee02;
  }

  .custom-prose strong {
    color: #111827;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* Dark mode text readability fix */
  .dark .custom-prose p,
  .dark .custom-prose li,
  .dark .custom-prose ul,
  .dark .custom-prose ol {
    color: #e2e8f0 !important;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose strong {
    color: #ffffff !important;
  }
</style>
